flowchart TB
    entry["命令分派<br/>scripts/rea.mjs"]
    cli["CLI 适配器<br/>src/cli.ts"]
    main["MCP 启动与关闭<br/>src/main.ts · src/main/"]
    composition["运行时装配<br/>src/composition/"]
    server["MCP 工具适配器<br/>src/server/"]
    contracts["工具输入输出契约<br/>src/contracts/"]
    application["共享分析工作流<br/>src/application/"]
    domain["事实、图、错误与 Evidence<br/>src/domain/"]
    adapters["文件读取与分析提供方<br/>src/artifacts/ · src/hopper/ · src/ghidra/ · src/ida/ 等"]
    process["子进程监督与身份<br/>src/process/"]
    session["会话、活动目标与证据账本<br/>BinarySession · EvidenceLedger"]

    entry -->|普通命令| cli
    entry -->|mcp 或 --mcp| main
    cli -.->|创建共享会话| composition
    main -.->|创建共享会话| composition
    main -->|启动 stdio| server
    composition -.->|装配提供方| adapters
    composition -.->|装配会话| session
    cli -->|调用| application
    server -->|绑定及校验| contracts
    server -->|调用| application
    server -->|准入及记录| session
    application -->|生成和验证| domain
    application -->|通过端口读取或分析| adapters
    session -->|留存 Evidence| domain
    adapters -->|需要子进程时使用| process

    %% 实线为运行时调用或数据关系，虚线为装配关系；不是完整 import 图。
    classDef entrypoint fill:#e0f2fe,stroke:#0369a1,color:#0c4a6e
    classDef core fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#15803d,color:#14532d
    classDef boundary fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#b45309,color:#78350f
    class entry,cli,main,server entrypoint
    class application,domain,contracts,session core
    class composition,adapters,process boundary
